<!doctype html>

<html lang="en-CA" dir="ltr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Climate Solutions</title>
    <link href="/css/main.css" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('./partials/navbar', {page: '/'}) %>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="hero bg-base-200 min-h-[40vh] mb-8">
              <div class="hero-content text-center">
                <div class="max-w-md">
                  <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">Our projects</h1>
                  <p class="py-6">Take a look at our projects.</p>
                  <a href="/solutions/projects">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary">Projects</button>
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
      
            <div class="flex justify-between gap-6 mb-8">
              <!-- biomass power -->
              <div class="w-1/3 border-2">
                <figure>
                  <img class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/solutions/solution_biomass01.jpg" alt="Biomass Power Plant" />
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <h2 class="card-title">Biomass Power</h2>
                  <p>Biomass feedstock can replace fossil fuels for generating heat and electricity. Perennial biomass offers a "bridge" to a clean, renewable energy future.</p>
                  <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                    <a href="/solutions/projects/4">
                      <button class="btn btn-primary">Biomass Power</button>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
      
              <!-- bamboo production -->
              <div class="w-1/3 border-2">
                <figure>
                  <img class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/solutions/Solution_Bamboo01.jpg" alt="Bamboo Production" />
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <h2 class="card-title">Bamboo Production</h2>
                  <p>Bamboo rapidly sequesters carbon in biomass and soil and can thrive on degraded lands. Long-lived bamboo products can store carbon over time.</p>
                  <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                    <a href="/solutions/projects/6">
                      <button class="btn btn-primary">Bamboo Production</button>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
      
              <!-- composting -->
              <div class="w-1/3 border-2">
                <figure>
                  <img class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://drawdown.org/sites/default/files/solutions/solution_composting01.jpg" alt="Composting" />
                </figure>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <h2 class="card-title">Composting</h2>
                  <p>Composting can range from backyard bins to industrial-scale operations. Regardless, it converts organic waste into soil carbon, averting landfill methane emissions in the process.</p>
                  <div class="card-actions justify-end">
                    <a href="/solutions/projects/12">
                      <button class="btn btn-primary">Composting</button>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </body>
      </html>